⭐Update News⭐
Today we released a minor update that fixes bugs:
- The virtual keyboard now doesn't obscure the player name input field;
- The "Home Plan" and "Into the Second Part of the Room" buttons now display correctly on different devices;
- Fixed "invisible ink" mode;
- Fixed a bug where text messages did not match the selected gender;
- Fixed an authorization error where some players could not log into the game.
⚡Puppeteer is waiting for you!⚡

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/24294817/4339732ae1a8b1d7fc356cb37a071472c1b16bd2.jpg[/img]

⭐Update News⭐
Today we have released a major update that concerns the interface of the mobile version of the game:
- The main menu has been moved to the top of the screen and has become more convenient and functional;
- Friends panel moved to a separate tab;
- The game space has been enlarged;
- The playing field in boss battles has been enlarged;
⚡We continue to improve the game for you. Hurry up and try the innovations⚡

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/24294817/4339732ae1a8b1d7fc356cb37a071472c1b16bd2.jpg[/img]

🔥 Promotion: "Beltane" is already in the game! 🔥
We redesigned the event and made it even more interesting and exciting! Now you need to collect significantly fewer items in order to complete the event completely and receive all possible rewards.
Plunge into spring holiday chores, decorate your room and light the fire! Offers:
        - 6 different lines of activities, each with its own valuable rewards;
        - Composite decor - freshen up your room with the May holiday pole and get useful effects;
        - Festive area on the plan of the house - light the Beltane Bonfire and get Festive Puzzle Pieces, Healers, items for interacting with Rats and Ravens, and much more;
        - Colorful puzzle and Special collections, for the collection of which there are excellent prizes;
        - Promotional Quests - Find out how the residents of the mansion celebrate Beltane with you!
And of course, during the whole action, surprises and gifts from the Puppeteer await you. Join the fun![img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/24294817/0093bc7cf04aa37b9d6cd66ab43e47baf232284c.jpg[/img]
